{"last_link_id": 21, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\"The input is a split-screen reference image:\n\nLeft Side (Product): A specific pair of shoes with distinct colors, textures, and design details.\n\nRight Side (Subject): A model standing or walking, showing their feet/lower body.\n\nTask: Create a single seamless photo where the model from the right side is wearing the exact shoes from the left side.\n\nTechnical Directives:\n\nAnatomical Fit: Precisely replace the model's original footwear with the shoes from the left. Ensure the shoes fit the model's feet size and orientation perfectly.\n\nPerspective Alignment: Adjust the 3D perspective of the shoes to match the angle of the model's feet (e.g., if the model is seen from behind, show the heel of the shoe).\n\nShadows & Contact: Generate realistic contact shadows where the shoes touch the ground and ambient occlusion where the shoes meet the model's ankles/socks.\n\nDetail Retention: Maintain all specific patterns, lace styles, and material textures of the product from the left side.\n\nStyle: High-end fashion catalog photography, 8k, ultra-sharp focus on footwear, clean studio background.\""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [571.8131713867188, 352.2371826171875], "pos": [1880.24560546875, 1402.60302734375], "id": 25, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [18, 20], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [315, 102], "pos": [1865.3748779296875, 438.2192687988281], "widgets_values": ["right", true], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 14, "label": "图像_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"name": "image2", "link": 15, "label": "图像_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"widget": {"name": "direction"}, "name": "direction", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "方向"}, {"widget": {"name": "match_image_size"}, "name":